{"ref":"BDB, תֵּימָנִי","hw":"תֵּימָנִי","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּימָנִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> always c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיפַז הַתֵּימָנִי</span> (v. supr.) <a data-ref=\"Job 2:11\" href=\"/Job.2.11\">Jb 2:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 4:1\" href=\"/Job.4.1\">4:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 15:1\" href=\"/Job.15.1\">15:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 42:7\" href=\"/Job.42.7\">42:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 42:9\" href=\"/Job.42.9\">9</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱל׳ הַתֵּמָנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:1\" href=\"/Job.22.1\">22:1</a>; = n.pr.coll. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶין הַתּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:34\" href=\"/Genesis.36.34\">Gn 36:34</a> <em>the land of the Temanites</em> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:45\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.45\">1 Ch 1:45</a>.","next":"BDB, תֵּימְנִי","prev":"BDB, תֵּימָן²"}